msgctxt ""
"@info under the Auto Run switch; Settings and Auto Run are the menu's words"
msgid ""
"Runs the first time the background engine starts after you log in. Once you "
"stop it, it stays stopped until you log in again. Settings › Auto Run changes"
" this for every session."
